---
title: Bean Salad
author: Grandma Gustad
category: Salads
source: Loving Memories of Mildred
---

@garbanzo beans{1%can} (drained)
@yellow beans{1%can} (drained)
@green beans{1%can} (drained)
@kidney beans{2%cans} (drained)
@green pepper{1%finely chopped}
@salt{1%tsp}
@vinegar{1/2%c}
@onion{1%finely chopped}
@pepper{1/2%tsp}
@sugar{3/4%c}
@salad oil{1/2%c}

Mix and set aside beans. Mix together pepper, salt, sugar, vinegar, salad oil, and onion and pour over beans. Let stand 6 to 7 hours before serving.
